{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NIGHT OF THE WENDIGO</strong> is a Virtual Reality horror experience in which a peaceful day of hiking becomes a night of survival! The game is an intuitive, addictive VR experience that is best enjoyed by taking turns with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/extras/5e4973f7d20f72886452ad2edab6ffcc.poster.avif?t=1747955552\" width=434 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/extras/5e4973f7d20f72886452ad2edab6ffcc.webm?t=1747955552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/extras/5e4973f7d20f72886452ad2edab6ffcc.mp4?t=1747955552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must survive the night using their rechargeable flashlight to fend against forest animals such as deer, wolves, and the legendary Wendigo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/extras/24d3da4dc3c25dc7c870431597ae0b46.poster.avif?t=1747955552\" width=434 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/extras/24d3da4dc3c25dc7c870431597ae0b46.webm?t=1747955552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/extras/24d3da4dc3c25dc7c870431597ae0b46.mp4?t=1747955552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling Survival Mode can be unlocked where the player is armed with a pump-action shotgun after playing through the main Story Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/extras/45f70418b4ab41a2478ab2ff4d593fe6.poster.avif?t=1747955552\" width=434 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/extras/45f70418b4ab41a2478ab2ff4d593fe6.webm?t=1747955552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/extras/45f70418b4ab41a2478ab2ff4d593fe6.mp4?t=1747955552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br>- 10-20 minute Story Mode<br>- Endless Survival Mode!<br>- Intuitive, easy-to-understand gameplay<br>- Scary, scripted sequences and potential threats from any direction<br>- Roomscale experience. No need to worry about motion sickness!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Luck!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/74ff2bc880ddfb1c3b24a9294ff81c1dc31090f3.jpg"},{"name":"Deer Blaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/291624b88f8438b9dcda2c74a416571d015ca7c7.jpg"},{"name":"Hungry Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/e3bc76669ba427571ef4d17c39242d8b165ad0a3.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/f984ecee20edcc577a87799678d57366a9c361be.jpg"},{"name":"Survivalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/533b93c1cff7a4546a003a16b319a2f374620fce.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3440790/c8036cc44b5425752f2415cad035b2dc2ad44c27.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni